(
    title: "Angry Video Game Nerd K.O. Boxing",
    developer: Some("Devin Cook"),
    description: Some("A homebrew boxing game in the Punch-Out mould, pitting you against the cast of James Rolfe\'s Angry Video Game Nerd web series — the Nerd himself, Bugs Bunny, the Joker, Jason and others, up to a final bout with the Super Nerd. Each opponent has its own attack patterns you have to read and block, since a solid defence is what opens the window to counterpunch. It is a sequel to the same author\'s K.O. Cruiser."),
